# The repository stores text with LF. Without this, Git on Windows checks
# files out as CRLF, and anything that parses repository files byte-for-byte
# — the retention migration check, the design-token contrast check — sees
# content that CI's Linux runners never produce. Failures of that kind are
# invisible in CI and land on whoever is on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
